---
// src/components/storefront/BrandStory.astro
---
<section class="w-full py-32 bg-[#0b1516] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 items-center gap-16">
      
      <div class="md:col-span-5 relative order-2 md:order-1">
        <div class="absolute -top-20 -left-20 text-[15rem] font-bold text-[#dae5e6]/[0.02] pointer-events-none select-none font-mono">
          34%
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="block text-6xl md:text-8xl font-bold text-white font-mono tracking-tighter mb-4">34<span class="text-[#36f4a4]">%</span></span>
          <p class="text-sm font-mono text-[#dae5e6]/50 uppercase tracking-widest max-w-[200px]">Average customer savings across all categories since launch.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-7 order-1 md:order-2">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-8">
          Built for people who refuse to overpay.
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-[#dae5e6]/70 leading-relaxed text-lg font-light max-w-xl">
          <p>
            Symeno wasn't founded by retailers. It was founded by analysts who realized that global supply chain efficiencies were never reaching the end customer.
          </p>
          <p>
            We operate on a simple thesis: Volume is power. By aggregating demand and negotiating bulk positions with authorized brand partners, we can collapse the retail margin.
          </p>
          <p>
            We don't do flash sales. We don't do fake timers. We provide the structural best price, every single day.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10">
          <a href="/about" class="text-white font-medium text-sm border-b border-[#36f4a4]/40 pb-1 hover:border-[#36f4a4] transition-colors">
            Our Sourcing Ethics &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
